  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gidioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abaisraeli bagakora ebibe naende ase obosio bw’Omonene, n’Omonene akababeeka ase amaboko y’Abamidiani ase engaki y’emiaka etano n’ebere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abamidiani nigo baabaengerete Abaisraeli, na ase engencho y’Abamidiani Abaisraeli bakabetererigwa korigia obotamero ase amakuruma na emetaro, na ase chingoro chiakuunyire ase ebitunwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kero kende gionsi Abaisraeli barenge kobusura chimbusuro chiabo, Abamimidiani, n’Abaameleki, n’abanto ba moocha nigo baare goocha baabarwania esegi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakaba bagotoora ase ense y’Abaisraeli, erio basaria chindagera chiabo goika chimbebe chia Gasa. Tibaare gotigareria Abaisraeli ching’ondi, gose chiombe, gose chitigere, nonya ngento kende gionsi Abaisraeli baare koria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nigo barenge goocha amo ne chitugo chiabo ne chiema chiabo, nigo bareenge abange buna chingige. Omobaro obo torenge kobareka barabwo abanyene ne chingamia chiabo. Bagasoa ase ense eria, bakagania koyesaria kegima.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase ayio Abaisraeli bagakorwa koba abataka mono ase engencho y’Abamidiani; erio bakarera ase Omonene ng’a abakoonye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Abaisraeli barerete ase Omonene ase engencho y’Abamidiani,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akabatomera omobani, na ere akabarentera amang’ana aya korwa ase Omonene. ’’Omonene Nyasae bw’Abaisraeli, nigo agoteeba, Ninche nabarusetie Misiri, ense eria ase mwarenge abasomba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ’nkabatooria korwa ase Abamisiri, na korwa ase abanto bonsi baabachaandete ase ense eyio. ’Nkabaseeria, bakarua ase obosio bwaino, erio ’nkabaa inwe ense yabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "’Nkabateebia: Inche ninche Omonene Nyasae oino, timobaisa koiroka chinyasae chi’Abaamori, abwo momenyete ase ense yabo. Korende timoigwereti amang’ana ane.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omomalaika bw’Omonene agacha, agaikaransa inse y’omote oyio okorokwa Omoaluni agwo omochie bw’Ofura, oyio orenge o Yoashi, omonto bw’eamate y’Abieseri. Gidioni, omomura oye, nigo arenge koora engano ase ekemitero gi’edivai, erinde Abamidiani tibaayenyora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omomalaika bw’Omonene akamoorokera agwo, akamoteebia, “Omonene nigo are amo naye, aye omonto omoremu ase okorwana esegi!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni agakwana nere, agateeba, “Aye Omonene one, onye Omonene ore amo naintwe, nase ki rende aya onsi atonyorire? Naende ng’ai ogokora kwaye gwe chinguru kore koria chisokoro chiaito chiatoteebetie ng’a Omonene nere otorusetie Misiri? Na b’Omonene otwangire na gotobeeka ase amaboko y’Abamidiani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri’Omonene akeonchora gochia ase are, akamoteebia, “Genda ne chinguru echio chiao, otoorie Abaisraeli korwa ase amaboko ya Abamidiani. Inche ninche nagotomire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akamobooria, “Omonene, inaki ’ndakore ’mbatoorie Abaisraeli? Egesaku kiaane nigo kere egeke kobua ebisaku binde ase eamate ya Manase, na ase enka ya tata inche tindi omonto omanyekanete.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omonene akamoiraneria, “Inche nimbe amo naye, naye nobaite Abamidiani buna oyogoita omonto oyomo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akamoteebia, “Omonene, onye nanyorire ogwancherwa ase ore, inyorokie ekemanyererio ng’a aye naye ogokwana nainche.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Koranche, torua aiga goika nkorentere okoruegwa kwane kw’endagera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omomalaika oria akamoiraneria, “Nimbeere aa, ’nkoganye goika oirane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Gidioni akageenda nyomba mwaye, akanyenya emanwa y’embori, akayeroisia; naende korwa ase obosie bw’ekerengo ki’ebimunu bibere akaroisia emegati etabeekiri memera. Akabeeka chinyama ase egetonga, na omosori akayoumora ase enyongo, akairera omomalaika oria endagera eyio agwo aase arenge inse y’omote okorokwa oaki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omomalaika oria o Nyasae akamoteebia, “Imokia chinyama echi na emegati eye etabeekiri memera, obibeeke igoro ase egetare eke, naende obiumorere omosori oyio.” Gidioni agakora boigo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omomalaika oria akarambora okoboko kwaye, na ase mesia y’enyimbo yaye agakuna chinyama chiria na emegati eria etabeekiri memera. Aroro agwo omorero ogatuboka ogoka korwa ase egetare keria ime, ne’chinyama echio amo nemegati eyio bigasambwa bikayia bikaera. Na omomalaika oria bw’Omonene akarua ase Gidioni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Gidioni akamanya ng’a oria n’omomalaika bw’Omonene orenge, akabora, “Ani! Aye Omonene ’Nyasae! Narorire omomalaika oo obosio ase obosio.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Omonene akamoteebia, “Omorembe obe amo naye! Toiroka! Aye togokwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Gidioni akaagachera Omonene egesasiimero aroro agwo, agakeroka Salomu",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "Egesasiimero ekio nigo geteneine agwo omochie bw’eamate y’Abieseri okorokwa Ofura, nonya ngoika reero iga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase obotuko bori’Omonene agateebia Gidioni, “Imokia eeri ya iso, na eeri eyemo ende ere n’emiaka etano n’ebere, naende otagore egesasiimero gia iso, keria aagacherete Baali, okeiyerie inse; naende onache emete y’Asera, enyasae yabo enkuungu, ere ensemo y’egesasiimero keria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio ong’agaachere inche Omonene, Nyasae oo, egesasiimero, ase ogochooka amagena buya igoro ase egekengero eke egekong’u. Erio orente eeri eria ya kabere, oyerue ebe ekeng’wanso ki’ogosambwa, oyesambere chinko chi’omote oria bw’enyasae ya Asera ogochia konacha.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akaimoka amo n’abasomba baye ikomi, agakora buna Omonene amoteebetie. Bono akayakora ayio botuko tayakora aya ekero kia mobaso, ekiagera arenge n’obwoba ase abanto b’eamate yaye, na ab’omochie obo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko ria kabere, ekero abanto babogete mambia chuni, bakanyora ng’a egesasiimero gia Baali giatagoirwe amo n’omote oria bw’Asera orenge ensemo yaye, naende bakarora ng’a eeri eria ya kabere yarusiigwe yakoreirwe ekeng’wanso igoro ase egesasiimero keria konya kiaagachirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakaboorania, “Ning’o okorete amang’ana aya?” Ekero baare koboria na kounenkia oyokorete ayio, bakanyora ng’a Gidioni, mosinto o Yoashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio abanto b’omochie oria bagateebia Yoashi, “Morente omomura oyio oo aiga, ere goika aitwe, ekiagera otagoire egesasiimero gia Baali, na otagoire omote oria bw’Asera orenge ensemo yaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yoashi agateebia abwo bonsi baachete koamererania nere, “Inee! Ninwe mokorwanerera Baali? Gose ninwe mokoyeegera? Onde bwensi okoyerwanerera goika aitwe ritang’ani emambia ende etaraika. Onye Baali n’enyasae, tiga erwanerere ere bweka omonyene. Egesasiimero kiaye nakio giatagoirwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korwa rituko riria Gidioni akarokwa Yerubi‐Baali, engencho yaye, “Tiga Baali omonyene erwanerere” ekiagera Gidioni atagorete egesasiimero kiaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Abamidiani n’Abaameleki, n’abanto ba moocha bagasangererekana amo, na ekero bambokire Yorodani bagatoora ase ense ye rikura ria Yesireeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akabwatwane’chinguru chi’Omoika Omonene. Ere akabugia egetureeri gi’eseegi, na ab’Abieseri bakarangerigwa bakamobwatia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende agatoma abanto ase orogongo rwonsi rw’ abanto b’eamate ya Manase barangerie abanto b’aroro bamobwatie. Naboigo akarangeria abanto b’eamate ya’Aseri, na egia Sabuloni, na ekia Nafutali; barabwo bakamotunyaya.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni agateebia Nyasae, “Aye gwateebire ng’a norigetie gotooria Abaisraeli goetera ase okoboko kwane. Onye ere boigo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "rora,’ nkobeeka’nde risankwa rire n’amarionya ye’ching’ondi ase ekeooreri gekoorerwa; obotooru bokoba ase risankwa riria rire namarionya oka, korende riroba ribe eriomo, erio nario ndamanye ng’a aye notoorie Abaisraeli goetera ase okoboko kwane, buna gwateebire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayio akaba boigo. Ekero Gidioni abogete mambia chuni, akamita risankwa riria, akanyititora amaache y’obotooru, egetaabo kegaichora.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni agakwana na Nyasae, akamoteebia, “Nyasae, totiga endamwamu yao yoke ase ’nde, korende ing’a ribaga ’nkwane naye rimo naende. Tiga nteeme rimo naende ne risankwa eri. Na bono ekero eke kora iga ’ng’a risankwa ribe eriomo, korende obotooru bobe inse ase riroba rionsi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ase obotuko boria Nyasae agakora bo; mambia yaye risankwa nigo riarenge eriomo, korende inse riroba rionsi rikaba rinyiu ase obotooru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.6.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
